<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA INDUSTRY OUTPUT DOWN 18 PCT YR/YR IN NOV.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA INDUSTRY OUTPUT DOWN 18 PCT YR/YR IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output</p>
<p>rose 13 percent in November but was 18-percent below year ago</p>
<p>levels, a report from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    Nov '96 Oct '96   Nov '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		   +13.0	+41.1	+6.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    -18.0	-27.4     +14.6</p>
<p>Industrial output dropped nine percent in January-November</p>
<p>of this year, compared with a 5.1-percent fall in the same</p>
<p>period last year, the report said.</p>
</text>
